{"id":"81346d5d25940fd3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/085_聚焦相继式演算_Focused_Sequents.md","title":"085 聚焦相继式演算","display":"085_聚焦相继式演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-极性公式语言\">1. 极性公式语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop^+=\\{p_i^+:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop^+=\\{p_i^+:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop^-=\\{p_i^-:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop^-=\\{p_i^-:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。正公式与负公式同时定义为最小集合：</p>\n<p>正公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm^+\">\\(Frm^+\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop^+\">\\(p\\in Prop^+\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"patm(p)\\in Frm^+\">\\(patm(p)\\in Frm^+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"one\\in Frm^+\">\\(one\\in Frm^+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in Frm^+\">\\(P,Q\\in Frm^+\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"tensor(P,Q)\\in Frm^+\">\\(tensor(P,Q)\\in Frm^+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in Frm^-\">\\(N\\in Frm^-\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"down(N)\\in Frm^+\">\\(down(N)\\in Frm^+\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>负公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm^-\">\\(Frm^-\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Prop^-\">\\(q\\in Prop^-\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"natm(q)\\in Frm^-\">\\(natm(q)\\in Frm^-\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"top\\in Frm^-\">\\(top\\in Frm^-\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,M\\in Frm^-\">\\(N,M\\in Frm^-\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"with(N,M)\\in Frm^-\">\\(with(N,M)\\in Frm^-\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in Frm^+\">\\(P\\in Frm^+\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"up(P)\\in Frm^-\">\\(up(P)\\in Frm^-\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义原子对偶函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual^+(p_i^+)=p_i^-,\n\\qquad\ndual^-(p_i^-)=p_i^+.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual^+(p_i^+)=p_i^-,\n\\qquad\ndual^-(p_i^-)=p_i^+.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始对偶谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"DualAt(patm(p),natm(q))\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nq=dual^+(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[DualAt(patm(p),natm(q))\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nq=dual^+(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-变量与替换\">2. 变量与替换</h1>\n<p>变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV^+\">\\(PV^+\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV^-\">\\(PV^-\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV^+(patm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV^+(one)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV^+(patm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV^+(one)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV^+(tensor(P,Q))=PV^+(P)\\cup PV^+(Q),\n\\quad\nPV^+(down(N))=PV^-(N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV^+(tensor(P,Q))=PV^+(P)\\cup PV^+(Q),\n\\quad\nPV^+(down(N))=PV^-(N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV^-(natm(q))=\\{q\\},\\quad PV^-(top)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV^-(natm(q))=\\{q\\},\\quad PV^-(top)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV^-(with(N,M))=PV^-(N)\\cup PV^-(M),\n\\quad\nPV^-(up(P))=PV^+(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV^-(with(N,M))=PV^-(N)\\cup PV^-(M),\n\\quad\nPV^-(up(P))=PV^+(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F=\\{(\\sigma^+,\\sigma^-):\\sigma^+:Prop^+\\to Frm^+,\\ \\sigma^-:Prop^-\\to Frm^-\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F=\\{(\\sigma^+,\\sigma^-):\\sigma^+:Prop^+\\to Frm^+,\\ \\sigma^-:Prop^-\\to Frm^-\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\sigma^+,\\sigma^-)\\in Sub_F\">\\((\\sigma^+,\\sigma^-)\\in Sub_F\\)</span>，其扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(patm(p))=\\sigma^+(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma^+(one)=one,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(patm(p))=\\sigma^+(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma^+(one)=one,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(tensor(P,Q))=tensor(\\widehat\\sigma^+(P),\\widehat\\sigma^+(Q)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(tensor(P,Q))=tensor(\\widehat\\sigma^+(P),\\widehat\\sigma^+(Q)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(down(N))=down(\\widehat\\sigma^-(N)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(down(N))=down(\\widehat\\sigma^-(N)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^-(natm(q))=\\sigma^-(q),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma^-(top)=top,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^-(natm(q))=\\sigma^-(q),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma^-(top)=top,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^-(with(N,M))=with(\\widehat\\sigma^-(N),\\widehat\\sigma^-(M)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^-(with(N,M))=with(\\widehat\\sigma^-(N),\\widehat\\sigma^-(M)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^-(up(P))=up(\\widehat\\sigma^+(P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^-(up(P))=up(\\widehat\\sigma^+(P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-聚焦相继式状态\">3. 聚焦相继式状态</h1>\n<p>上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是负公式有限多重集。正焦点集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Focus^+=\\{focus(P):P\\in Frm^+\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Focus^+=\\{focus(P):P\\in Frm^+\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>负焦点集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Focus^-=\\{focus(N):N\\in Frm^-\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Focus^-=\\{focus(N):N\\in Frm^-\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>状态集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FSeq\">\\(FSeq\\)</span> 是下列三类对象的并：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>稳定状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta)\">\\(stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是负公式多重集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 是正公式多重集。</li>\n<li>正聚焦状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pos(\\Gamma;focus(P))\">\\(pos(\\Gamma;focus(P))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>负反聚焦状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(\\Gamma;focus(N))\">\\(neg(\\Gamma;focus(N))\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义相位集合与相位函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Phase}_{F}=\\{\\mathsf{stable},\\mathsf{pos},\\mathsf{neg}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Phase}_{F}=\\{\\mathsf{stable},\\mathsf{pos},\\mathsf{neg}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}:FSeq\\to\\mathsf{Phase}_{F}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{phase}_{F}:FSeq\\to\\mathsf{Phase}_{F}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta))=\\mathsf{stable},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta))=\\mathsf{stable},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(pos(\\Gamma;focus(P)))=\\mathsf{pos},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(neg(\\Gamma;focus(N)))=\\mathsf{neg}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(pos(\\Gamma;focus(P)))=\\mathsf{pos},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(neg(\\Gamma;focus(N)))=\\mathsf{neg}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出。三个状态构造子的像互不相交，故每个状态有唯一相位。</p>\n<p>上下文拆分谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Split_F(\\Gamma,\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma=\\Gamma_0+\\Gamma_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Split_F(\\Gamma,\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma=\\Gamma_0+\\Gamma_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>稳定状态侧条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Stable_F(\\Gamma;\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm^-)\\land\n\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm^+).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Stable_F(\\Gamma;\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm^-)\\land\n\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm^+).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-初始与相位切换\">4. 初始与相位切换</h1>\n<p>初始关系（恒等公理，允许任意陪域上下文）为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_F\n=\n\\{stable(\\Gamma+\\{natm(dual^+(p))\\};\\Delta+\\{patm(p)\\}):\np\\in Prop^+\\land Stable_F(\\Gamma;\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_F\n=\n\\{stable(\\Gamma+\\{natm(dual^+(p))\\};\\Delta+\\{patm(p)\\}):\np\\in Prop^+\\land Stable_F(\\Gamma;\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即稳定状态中只要左上下文含某负原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"natm(q)\">\\(natm(q)\\)</span> 且右上下文含其对偶正原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"patm(dual^-(q))\">\\(patm(dual^-(q))\\)</span>，即为公理（取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=dual^-(q)\">\\(p=dual^-(q)\\)</span> 即得该形）。</p>\n<p>正选择规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{select}^+\n=\n\\{((pos(\\Gamma;focus(P))),stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta+\\{P\\})):\nStable_F(\\Gamma;\\Delta+\\{P\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{select}^+\n=\n\\{((pos(\\Gamma;focus(P))),stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta+\\{P\\})):\nStable_F(\\Gamma;\\Delta+\\{P\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>负选择规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{select}^-\n=\n\\{((neg(\\Gamma;focus(N))),stable(\\Gamma+\\{N\\};\\Delta)):\nStable_F(\\Gamma+\\{N\\};\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{select}^-\n=\n\\{((neg(\\Gamma;focus(N))),stable(\\Gamma+\\{N\\};\\Delta)):\nStable_F(\\Gamma+\\{N\\};\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>释放规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{release}\n=\n\\{((stable(\\Gamma+\\{N\\};\\varnothing)),pos(\\Gamma;focus(down(N))))\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((stable(\\Gamma;\\{P\\})),neg(\\Gamma;focus(up(P))))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{release}\n=\n\\{((stable(\\Gamma+\\{N\\};\\varnothing)),pos(\\Gamma;focus(down(N))))\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((stable(\\Gamma;\\{P\\})),neg(\\Gamma;focus(up(P))))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-同步正规则\">5. 同步正规则</h1>\n<p>正单位规则为（按线性逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1R\">\\(1R\\)</span> 要求上下文为空，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\otimes\">\\(Rule_\\otimes\\)</span> 的上下文拆分协调）</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{one}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,pos(\\varnothing;focus(one)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{one}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,pos(\\varnothing;focus(one)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正原子聚焦闭包规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{init+}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,pos(\\Gamma;focus(patm(p)))):\np\\in Prop^+\\land natm(dual^+(p))\\in\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{init+}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,pos(\\Gamma;focus(patm(p)))):\np\\in Prop^+\\land natm(dual^+(p))\\in\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即正原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"patm(p)\">\\(patm(p)\\)</span> 处于焦点位时，只要负上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 已含其对偶原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"natm(dual^+(p))\">\\(natm(dual^+(p))\\)</span>，该聚焦状态即为公理（空前提组）。</p>\n<p>正张量规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((pos(\\Gamma_0;focus(P)),pos(\\Gamma_1;focus(Q))),pos(\\Gamma;focus(tensor(P,Q)))):\nSplit_F(\\Gamma,\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((pos(\\Gamma_0;focus(P)),pos(\\Gamma_1;focus(Q))),pos(\\Gamma;focus(tensor(P,Q)))):\nSplit_F(\\Gamma,\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-异步负规则\">6. 异步负规则</h1>\n<p>负顶规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\top}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,neg(\\Gamma;focus(top)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\top}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,neg(\\Gamma;focus(top)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>负合取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\&amp;}\n=\n\\{((neg(\\Gamma;focus(N)),neg(\\Gamma;focus(M))),neg(\\Gamma;focus(with(N,M))))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\&amp;}\n=\n\\{((neg(\\Gamma;focus(N)),neg(\\Gamma;focus(M))),neg(\\Gamma;focus(with(N,M))))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_F=Rule_{select}^+\\cup Rule_{select}^-\\cup Rule_{release}\n\\cup Rule_{one}\\cup Rule_{init+}\\cup Rule_{\\otimes}\\cup Rule_{\\top}\\cup Rule_{\\&amp;}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_F=Rule_{select}^+\\cup Rule_{select}^-\\cup Rule_{release}\n\\cup Rule_{one}\\cup Rule_{init+}\\cup Rule_{\\otimes}\\cup Rule_{\\top}\\cup Rule_{\\&amp;}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义选择、存储和释放证书关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SelectCert}_{F}(P,S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((P),S)\\in Rule_{select}^{+},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SelectCert}_{F}(P,S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((P),S)\\in Rule_{select}^{+},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StoreCert}_{F}(P,S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((P),S)\\in Rule_{select}^{-},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StoreCert}_{F}(P,S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((P),S)\\in Rule_{select}^{-},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReleaseCert}_{F}(P,S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((P),S)\\in Rule_{release}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ReleaseCert}_{F}(P,S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n((P),S)\\in Rule_{release}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义带标签相位转移许可</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F}(\\bar P,S,w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F}(\\bar P,S,w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当恰有下列一种情形：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\mathsf{select}\">\\(w=\\mathsf{select}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar P=(P)\">\\(\\bar P=(P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SelectCert}_{F}(P,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{SelectCert}_{F}(P,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(P)=\\mathsf{pos}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(P)=\\mathsf{pos}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{stable}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{stable}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\mathsf{store}\">\\(w=\\mathsf{store}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar P=(P)\">\\(\\bar P=(P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StoreCert}_{F}(P,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{StoreCert}_{F}(P,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(P)=\\mathsf{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(P)=\\mathsf{neg}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{stable}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{stable}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\mathsf{release}\">\\(w=\\mathsf{release}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar P=(P)\">\\(\\bar P=(P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReleaseCert}_{F}(P,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{ReleaseCert}_{F}(P,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(P)=\\mathsf{stable}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(P)=\\mathsf{stable}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)\\in\\{\\mathsf{pos},\\mathsf{neg}\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)\\in\\{\\mathsf{pos},\\mathsf{neg}\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{\\mathsf{one},\\mathsf{init+},\\mathsf{tensor}\\}\">\\(w\\in\\{\\mathsf{one},\\mathsf{init+},\\mathsf{tensor}\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\bar P,S)\\in Rule_{one}\\cup Rule_{init+}\\cup Rule_{\\otimes}\">\\((\\bar P,S)\\in Rule_{one}\\cup Rule_{init+}\\cup Rule_{\\otimes}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{pos}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{pos}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{\\mathsf{top},\\mathsf{with}\\}\">\\(w\\in\\{\\mathsf{top},\\mathsf{with}\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\bar P,S)\\in Rule_{\\top}\\cup Rule_{\\&amp;}\">\\((\\bar P,S)\\in Rule_{\\top}\\cup Rule_{\\&amp;}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{phase}_{F}(S)=\\mathsf{neg}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>不存在满足这五类之一的证书时，相位转换失败。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-聚焦推导树\">7. 聚焦推导树</h1>\n<p>聚焦推导树由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{F}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F}\\)</span> 刻画。</p>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树、子节点和叶节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to FSeq.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to FSeq.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>直接前提标签列定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prem}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n=\n(\\lambda(m_i))_{i&lt;k},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prem}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n=\n(\\lambda(m_i))_{i&lt;k},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m_i)_{i&lt;k}\">\\((m_i)_{i&lt;k}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)\\)</span> 的递增枚举。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Init_F)\n\\lor\n\\exists w\\ \n\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F}\n(\\operatorname{Prem}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n),\\lambda(n),w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Init_F)\n\\lor\n\\exists w\\ \n\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F}\n(\\operatorname{Prem}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n),\\lambda(n),w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_F S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=S\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_F S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=S\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{F}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>稳定可导关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_F\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\vdash_F stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_F\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\vdash_F stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{FSeq}=\\{S\\in FSeq:\\vdash_F S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{FSeq}=\\{S\\in FSeq:\\vdash_F S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统把公式分为正负极性，并把推导状态分成非聚焦与聚焦相位；同步正规则只在焦点公式上推进，异步负规则在非聚焦相位推进。</p>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_F\n=\n(Frm^+,Frm^-,FSeq,Focus^+,Focus^-,\n\\operatorname{phase}_{F},\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F},\nRule_F,\\operatorname{Der}_{F},\\mathsf{Cn}_{FSeq}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_F\n=\n(Frm^+,Frm^-,FSeq,Focus^+,Focus^-,\n\\operatorname{phase}_{F},\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F},\nRule_F,\\operatorname{Der}_{F},\\mathsf{Cn}_{FSeq}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{FocusedSequents}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp^+,\nProp^-,\nFrm^+,\nFrm^-,\nPV^+,\nPV^-,\n\\widehat\\sigma^+,\n\\widehat\\sigma^-,\nSub_F,\nFocus^+,\nFocus^-,\nFSeq,\n\\mathsf{Phase}_{F},\n\\operatorname{phase}_{F},\ndual^+,\ndual^-,\nDualAt,\nSplit_F,\nStable_F,\nInit_F,\nRule_{select}^+,\nRule_{select}^-,\nRule_{release},\nRule_{one},\nRule_{init+},\nRule_{\\otimes},\nRule_{\\top},\nRule_{\\&amp;},\n\\operatorname{SelectCert}_{F},\n\\operatorname{StoreCert}_{F},\n\\operatorname{ReleaseCert}_{F},\n\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F},\nRule_F,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{F},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{F},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{F},\n\\vdash_F,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{FSeq},\n\\Delta_F\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{FocusedSequents}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp^+,\nProp^-,\nFrm^+,\nFrm^-,\nPV^+,\nPV^-,\n\\widehat\\sigma^+,\n\\widehat\\sigma^-,\nSub_F,\nFocus^+,\nFocus^-,\nFSeq,\n\\mathsf{Phase}_{F},\n\\operatorname{phase}_{F},\ndual^+,\ndual^-,\nDualAt,\nSplit_F,\nStable_F,\nInit_F,\nRule_{select}^+,\nRule_{select}^-,\nRule_{release},\nRule_{one},\nRule_{init+},\nRule_{\\otimes},\nRule_{\\top},\nRule_{\\&amp;},\n\\operatorname{SelectCert}_{F},\n\\operatorname{StoreCert}_{F},\n\\operatorname{ReleaseCert}_{F},\n\\operatorname{PhaseStep}_{F},\nRule_F,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{F},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{F},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{F},\n\\vdash_F,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{FSeq},\n\\Delta_F\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含极性公式、稳定状态、正/负聚焦相位和相位规则；不含无聚焦普通相继式推导或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-极性公式语言","text":"1. 极性公式语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-变量与替换","text":"2. 变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-聚焦相继式状态","text":"3. 聚焦相继式状态","level":1},{"id":"4.-初始与相位切换","text":"4. 初始与相位切换","level":1},{"id":"5.-同步正规则","text":"5. 同步正规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-异步负规则","text":"6. 异步负规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-聚焦推导树","text":"7. 聚焦推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop^+=\\{p_i^+:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Prop^-=\\{p_i^-:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop^+","display":false},{"tex":"patm(p)\\in Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"one\\in Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q\\in Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"tensor(P,Q)\\in Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"down(N)\\in Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Prop^-","display":false},{"tex":"natm(q)\\in Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"top\\in Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"N,M\\in Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"with(N,M)\\in Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in Frm^+","display":false},{"tex":"up(P)\\in Frm^-","display":false},{"tex":"dual^+(p_i^+)=p_i^-,\n\\qquad\ndual^-(p_i^-)=p_i^+.","display":true},{"tex":"DualAt(patm(p),natm(q))\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nq=dual^+(p).","display":true},{"tex":"PV^+","display":false},{"tex":"PV^-","display":false},{"tex":"PV^+(patm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV^+(one)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"PV^+(tensor(P,Q))=PV^+(P)\\cup PV^+(Q),\n\\quad\nPV^+(down(N))=PV^-(N),","display":true},{"tex":"PV^-(natm(q))=\\{q\\},\\quad PV^-(top)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"PV^-(with(N,M))=PV^-(N)\\cup PV^-(M),\n\\quad\nPV^-(up(P))=PV^+(P).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_F=\\{(\\sigma^+,\\sigma^-):\\sigma^+:Prop^+\\to Frm^+,\\ \\sigma^-:Prop^-\\to Frm^-\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\sigma^+,\\sigma^-)\\in Sub_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^+(patm(p))=\\sigma^+(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma^+(one)=one,","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^+(tensor(P,Q))=tensor(\\widehat\\sigma^+(P),\\widehat\\sigma^+(Q)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^+(down(N))=down(\\widehat\\sigma^-(N)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^-(natm(q))=\\sigma^-(q),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma^-(top)=top,","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^-(with(N,M))=with(\\widehat\\sigma^-(N),\\widehat\\sigma^-(M)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma^-(up(P))=up(\\widehat\\sigma^+(P)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"Focus^+=\\{focus(P):P\\in Frm^+\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Focus^-=\\{focus(N):N\\in Frm^-\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"FSeq","display":false},{"tex":"stable(\\Gamma;\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"pos(\\Gamma;focus(P))","display":false},{"tex":"neg(\\Gamma;focus(N))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Phase}_{F}=\\{\\mathsf{stable},\\mathsf{pos},\\mathsf{neg}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{phase}_{F}:FSeq\\to\\mathsf{Pha